@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #000000
skinparam ComponentFontColor #000000
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam RectangleFontColor #000000

title Linear Issue Flow After MCP Template Enforcement

actor "LLM / Agent" as Agent #E8F0FE
component "TypeScript MCP Server\n(linear-management-mcp)" as Mcp #D9EAD3
rectangle "Template Layer\n- built-in templates\n- env overrides\n- strict validation\n- normalization" as Templates #D0E0FF
component "Linear Wrapper\n(@linear/sdk)" as Wrapper #FFF4CC
component "Linear GraphQL API" as LinearApi #FFE5E5
database "Linear Workspace" as LinearData #EAF7EA

Agent --> Mcp : Tool calls\n(list/validate/normalize/create/apply)
Mcp --> Templates : Enforce section contract
Mcp --> Wrapper : Execute validated mutations
Wrapper --> LinearApi : createIssue / updateIssue
LinearApi --> LinearData : Persist normalized issue

note bottom of Templates #F3F3F3
Every write path can enforce required headings.
Descriptions become machine-readable and consistent.
end note

@enduml

